### Submit Session Feedback
POST http://localhost:5000/api/feedback
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <ATTENDEE_TOKEN>

{
  "eventId": "66d000000000000000000001",
  "sessionId": "66d000000000000000000015",
  "rating": 5,
  "comment": "Outstanding keynote! The architectural breakdown was exceptionally clear."
}

### View Feedback Stats
GET http://localhost:5000/api/feedback/stats/66d000000000000000000001
